{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14229130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14229130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422913001:0":{"text":"呼……钓累了，走一走，活动活动腿脚……","source_cn":"呼……钓累了，走一走，活动活动腿脚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB8F56C2D2824C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422913002:0":{"text":"咦，你这鱼护里不也空空如也，什么都没钓上来嘛！","source_cn":"咦，你这鱼护里不也空空如也，什么都没钓上来嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D37B16CA3602E10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422913003:1":{"text":"你对古岩鬣蜥是一点都不了解啊。打窝诱鱼的道理你不懂吗？","source_cn":"你对古岩鬣蜥是一点都不了解啊。打窝诱鱼的道理你不懂吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CBDC81B89F91D27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422913004:1":{"text":"我当然懂！我刚刚已经用鱼王喜欢的赤虾饵打了很久的窝……难道是鱼饵还不够？","source_cn":"我当然懂！我刚刚已经用鱼王喜欢的赤虾饵打了很久的窝……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39F6A85AA925D308","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422913005:1":{"text":"哈哈，这些话只能骗骗你这种新手了。","source_cn":"哈哈，这些话只能骗骗你这种新手了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x795007D328F1F907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","d